---

# A.9 Passport Extension Upsell

Only after the user understands the value:

> Your SeeItMyWay preferences currently work here.

> Want them to follow you to participating websites?

CTA:

**Get the SeeItMyWay Passport**

Extension benefits:

- stores expanded preferences
- optionally syncs them
- detects compatible sites
- shares only standardized approved preferences
- allows per-site overrides

This reverses typical extension onboarding.

Instead of:

> “Install this extension and trust us.”

the experience becomes:

> “You just created something useful. Would you like to carry it with you?”

